ginia.edu/scripps/index.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Scripps Library</a>.","source":"Lyndon B. Johnson Presidential Library","taper":"White House","subject":"Lyndon B. Johnson","publisher":"White House","numeric_id":"5436","boxid":"OL100020310","backup_location":"ia903600_5"},"reviews":[{"review_id":"45152","reviewbody":"The final tape in this collection :( is a continuation you could say of the previous tape about the airline strike that was paralizing the nation. Anyways, this part deals with the settlement, you hear the people who were doing the negotiations, telling, step by step, the progress the talks were having. Then when the agreement is reached, the pres phones up some people with the good news. Huzzah!","reviewtitle":"\"I can't talk now!\"","reviewer":"Spuzz","reviewdate":"2005-07-02 21:54:25","createdate":"2005-07-02 21:54:25","stars":"4"}],"server":"ia601306.us.archive.org","uniq":1871704254,"workable_servers":["ia601306.us.archive.org","ia801306.us.archive.org"]}